  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- Added a --self-test command-line switch to buildversion that proves the tool can start (loads native dependencies and builds the service provider) without doing any real work, exiting 0 on success or 1 with a one-line reason on stderr (#426)\n- buildversion is now published as a native AOT tool package for linux-x64, giving faster startup with no runtime install needed on linux runners\n- A framework-dependent 'any' tool package is still published as a fallback for platforms other than linux-x64, since native AOT cannot be cross-compiled\n### Fixed\n- Fixed backslash path separators in ProjectReference paths to satisfy the msbuild-path-separator check\n- Build number tag creation now re-reads the latest build-number tag and moves to the next free number when the number is already taken (HTTP 422), instead of retrying the same number, so concurrent builds no longer keep colliding on it (#408)\n- Renamed the BuildNumberEnvVar test constant to BUILD_NUMBER_ENV_VAR to satisfy the IDE1006 naming rule (#405)\n### Changed\n- Switched test projects from xunit.v3.mtp-v2 to the Native AOT-compatible xunit.v3.aot.mtp-v2 and bumped FunFair.Test.Common/FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.0.2617\n- Dependencies - Updated CSharpIsNullAnalyzer to 0.2.19\n- Restricted NuGet PackageReference asset flow (IncludeAssets) on non-analyzer packages to reduce build-time supply-chain risk, per meziantou.net guidance on limiting what NuGet packages can do\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Sbom.Targets to 4.1.13\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers to 18.12.1\n- Dependencies - Updated Roslynator.Analyzers to 5.0.1\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.19.0\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3\n- Updated to .NET 11 (net11.0, global.json SDK, runtime-async) - #421\n- SDK - Updated DotNet SDK to 11.0.100\n- Dependencies - Updated SonarAnalyzer.CSharp to 10.36.0.15337\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Extensions to 11.0.0\n- Dependencies - Updated NuGet to 8.0.0\n- Dependencies - Updated Philips.CodeAnalysis.MaintainabilityAnalyzers to 2.2.0\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.341\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Version.Information.Generator to 1.0.144.1853\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.161.2590\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.30.2708\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Extensions.Linq to 1.0.168.2245\n- Publish buildversion as a native AOT, trimmed dotnet tool\n- Removed the CommandLineParser dependency and replaced it with a trim-safe argument parser so the tool can be trimmed and published as native AOT; --help now exits 0\n- The nuget-publish action now packs the native AOT linux-x64 tool package and the framework-dependent fallback package\n- README updated to describe the native AOT linux-x64 package, the fallback package and the new command-line behaviour",
